; The compiler as JavaScript, for the playground: the same library the
; native executable is built from, with a browser-side entry point and
; the hand-written stub that registers it on the global object. Only
; js_of_ocaml is needed for this, and only here -- the library itself has
; no dependencies at all (see docs/build.md).
(executable
 (name pyking_web)
 (modes js)
 (libraries pyking)
 (js_of_ocaml
  (javascript_files stub.js))
 (flags
  (:standard -warn-error -a)))
